{"id":"ahi_","lemma":"ahí","pos":"adv","rank":100,"glosses":["there (away from the speaker)","that (in certain phrases)"],"ipa":"/aˈi/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/53/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Rodelar-ah%C3%AD.wav","examples":[{"text":"Te veo por ahí.","en":"See you around.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/441114"},{"text":"¿Está usted ahí dentro?","en":"Are you in there?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/412372"},{"text":"Por favor, siéntate ahí.","en":"Please sit there.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/586185"},{"text":"He ahí la oferta.","en":"That's the offer.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/443930"},{"text":"Ahí está la campana.","en":"There's the bell.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/443696"}]}